  "bodyHash": "1174207886e6dbea",
  "content": "\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">永恒皮肤</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skinrestorer\" rel=\"nofollow\">SkinRestorer 模组</a>&nbsp;的 Forge 移植版，支持即时更换皮肤并内置皮肤随机生成器</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">使用示例：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">通过 Mojang 账号昵称设置 Mojang 皮肤：<span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">/skin set mojang</span><em><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> Arthas</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">通过皮肤图片设置 4px 宽手臂的皮肤：<span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">/skin set web classic \"<em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fnovask.in%252f1791313075.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://novask.in/1791313075.png</a></em>\"</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">通过皮肤图片设置 3px 宽手臂的皮肤：<span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">/skin set web slim \"<em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fnovask.in%252f4802063321.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://novask.in/4802063321.png</a></em>\"</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">设置随机皮肤：<span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">/skin set random</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">设置 3px 宽手臂的随机皮肤：<span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> /skin set random slim</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">设置 4px 宽手臂的随机皮肤：<span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> /skin set random classic</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">设置带披风的 4px 宽手臂随机皮肤：<span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> /skin set random classic cape</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">设置带披风的 3px 宽手臂随机皮肤：<span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> /skin set random slim cape</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">获取你的皮肤来源（Mojang 昵称或网址）：<span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> /skin source</span>；<span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#999;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"> 在聊天栏点击该消息即可在浏览器中打开网址*</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">设置或恢复皮肤后，客户端无需重新连接（但重新连接可能修复某些错误）。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组仅服务端运行，无需安装在客户端。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
